  <item>
    <title>Vol.21 聊聊观察：在生活的空隙让感官透透气</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6348df4a2a992d56e91e5e3a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6348df4a2a992d56e91e5e3a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，这期节目有点特殊因为我请来了一个朋友小陈和我一起录制，你可以在</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61c7378da0048426c1636d6a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61c7378da0048426c1636d6a"><span>一步一步</span></a><span>找到他。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目中我们聊了：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>我们最近的有趣观察</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>用耳朵和皮肤观察自己和周围</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你好好地看过自己的脸吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>在社交环境里阅读空气</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>你觉得很厉害的观察</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>怕狗人士因为在看手机忽略了跑过来的小狗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>通勤路上耳机没电了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>好好看鸟和看花也是一种观察</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不插电的独自散步</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>电子榨菜与进食体验</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>我们拍下的：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsXE36MRfxHkYEAjTgzituTSPShC.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fll9kvr4ExLNWQWF6a9MgEcSvukk.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsplKOV-3fANYGMD42FuiyH_n_6_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FidSxIgWOzkt2ZZyuwwenhRrx6aQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkXxI7_j7lNZ9LMG_ld-TICJQxsF.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>我们提到的：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35205588/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35205588/"><span>约翰·威尔逊的十万个怎么做 第一季</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/27119942/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/27119942/"><span>路上观察学入门</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26611804/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26611804/"><span>三块广告牌</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30238385/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30238385/"><span>强风吹拂</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35206452/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35206452/"><span>脱口秀大会 第四季</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26895171/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/26895171/"><span>四重奏</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/34874432/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/34874432/"><span>花束般的恋爱</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>用到的音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Hello Nico-看不见？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Schoolgirl byebye-一般的生活</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luobQJbRu2N1aa7KxAvUZjd6HtX7.m4a" length="85292965" type="audio/mp4"/>
